Project to be reorg

1. replace background with clean background created with llm from a frame extracted from the product description part
2. attach banner
3. attach background music
4. attach captions
5. attach facial effects

How to run a demo:
1. get the sam2 setup
2. download the model files for the few models
3. run test_with_transitions under src/sam2/test.py with the video file to work on
4. run src/bgm/bgm_mixer.py with correct paths to attach bgm
5. generate caption objects in the same format as src/caption/resources/parsed.json with your own implementation
6. run src/caption/caption.py with proper paths